 him and has  even charged the hunter association with  thwarting his various plans meaning that  beyond is being set up to become the  primary antagonist of this arc and in  order for him to reach the dark  continent he needs four things  permission qualifications the means and  a contract beyond on his own does  possess one of these which is  qualifications as he has actually been  on a previous expedition so he does have  the experience needed to act as a guide  more on that later though because the  other three things are like very  important in terms of means beyond has  convinced kygnosabee of the kakin empire  to fund the trip kakin being this  absolutely massive isolated empire in  the world and was not part of the  current v5 ruling body which i guess is  kind of like our equivalent of the  united nations just  much more effective but king nasabi  wants a lot more than to simply explore  the continent his plan is to actually  move the empire and settle on the dark  continent ideally taking something of a  monopoly on its resources and turning  the kakin empire into the undisputed  world power however king nasty does have  a further twist in mind nasubi has  decided to use the voyage to host a  kakin ritual known as the succession war  which is essentially a death game  between the princes of the empire with  the sole survivor inheriting the title  of king but that that is a whole  different pandora's box that we will  need to open at a later date the second  faction beyond succeeded in manipulating  where the aforementioned v5 this is a  group of five nations who have each had  unsuccessful voyages to the dark  continent in the past and others now  acting as something of a global blockade  to dark continent travel what beyond  needed from the v5 was permission and he  obtained it like shockingly easily i  might add because as soon as the khakian  empire declared their intentions to  explore the dark continent the v5 were  left with three choices one go to war  with the kakin empire in order to stop  them from doing the thing two let them  go and do the thing and potentially  bring back a humanity-destroying  calamity with them or three join forces  with the empire and explore the  continent together and the v5 went with  option three transforming their  organization into the v6 in terms of  important characters we should flag  steiner he is a high ranking official  from a rather boringly named  organization called the international  permit agency but as such steiner is the  official head of this expedition  although he himself is incredibly aware  of the endeavour as everything he has  read about the dark continent shook him  to his core steiner himself believes  that the dark continent is not a place  humanity should return to under any  circumstances and yet here he is doing  the thing it is that he didn't want to  do but now that we have qualifications  permission and means what we need is a  contract something that binds everyone  together nice and tightly and that is  where the hunter association comes in  new chairman shiro yorkshire and the  remaining zodiacs were provided with a  video will from isaac natara imploring  them to explore the dark continent and  find some benefit for humanity but most  importantly to do so before his son  beyond and so the association agreed to  provide security on the voyage which i  think is important to point out the  association is not in charge of this  journey they are mere players like  everyone else also following the  resignation of both jing and paristan  the zodiacs had two free slots to film  one of which was taken by leorio mostly  due to his name recognition as now  accidentally one of the most famous  living hunters as a result of the  chairman election but he's basically  there for moral support people like  leorio and they believe in leorio and  therefore having him lead the charge on  this impossible voyage is well it's  comforting i guess more tangibly useful  t